{"case_id": "male_19710412_P005-Q24", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主名下拥有房产吗？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n命主八字为辛亥、壬辰、丁卯、戊申。日主丁火生于辰月，失令。月干透壬水正官，时干透戊土伤官，时支申金正财，年干辛金偏财，日支卯木偏印。\n\n- **房产相关十神**：通常以印星（木）代表房产，食伤（土）也可象征房屋，财星（金）为购买能力。\n- **印星分析**：日支卯木为偏印，是命主安身之所，直接代表名下房产。但卯与月支辰土相害（卯辰穿），又被时支申金暗合（卯申合），印星受损受制，暗示早期房产易有纠纷、损坏或转手。\n- **食伤分析**：月支辰土为伤官，时干戊土为伤官，土五行也主房产。辰土临月令，戊土透干，且戊土坐申金长生，伤官有力，代表命主能通过自身努力（伤官生财）购置不动产。\n- **组合推断**：印星卯木受制，但辰、戊两处明现的土无冲破，可为后期自置之房。明现之土共两处（辰与戊），故推断拥有两间公寓。财星申金有力，也支撑购房能力。\n\n### 最终答案\nB", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19710412_P005-Q24", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-final-2023\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g2\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 47574, "response_id": "8690a18e-cba1-4496-b999-22e9a68afd88", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 208, "completion_tokens": 2164, "total_tokens": 2372, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1852}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 80}}
